return ['domain'=>'zinn-backups','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'zinn-backups','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-08T09:17:23+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-08T09:17:23+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Backups'=>'Zinn® Backups','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-backups'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-backups','Backs up your WordPress files and database to your own storage — Dropbox, Google Drive, Cloudflare R2, Amazon S3 or any S3-compatible bucket — restores them in one go, and imports backups made by other backup and migration plugins.'=>'将您的 WordPress 文件和数据库备份到您自己的存储空间 — Dropbox、Google Drive、Cloudflare R2、Amazon S3 或任何兼容 S3 的存储桶 — 一次性恢复它们，并导入由其他备份和迁移插件创建的备份。','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Backups'=>'备份','Get Pro: schedules, several storages, encryption'=>'获取 Pro：计划任务、多个存储位置、加密','Working…'=>'正在处理…','Finished'=>'已完成','Failed'=>'失败','Cancelled'=>'已取消','Cancel'=>'取消','Restore'=>'恢复','Delete'=>'删除','Delete this backup from your storage? This cannot be undone.'=>'要从您的存储空间中删除此备份吗？此操作无法撤销。','No backups yet. Press “Back up now” to make the first one.'=>'尚无备份。请点击“立即备份”以创建第一个备份。','Reading your storage…'=>'正在读取您的存储空间…','a complete backup, as opposed to an incremental oneFull backup'=>'完整备份','a backup holding only what changed since an earlier oneIncremental backup'=>'增量备份','Encrypted'=>'已加密','From another site'=>'从其他站点','Database'=>'数据库','Files'=>'文件','Uploading %1$s: %2$s%%'=>'正在上传 %1$s：%2$s%%','Sign in to Dropbox in the window that opened, then paste the code Dropbox shows you:'=>'请在打开的窗口中登录 Dropbox，然后粘贴 Dropbox 向您显示的代码：','Saved.'=>'已保存。','Remove this destination from the plugin? The backups stored in it are not deleted.'=>'要从插件中移除此目标位置吗？存储在其中的备份不会被删除。','Reload the page to see the restored site.'=>'重新載入頁面以檢視已還原的網站。','Storage'=>'存储','Import & migrate'=>'导入与迁移','Settings'=>'设置','Sections'=>'区块','Google Drive is connected.'=>'Google Drive 已连接。','Google Drive could not be connected.'=>'无法连接 Google Drive。','Details'=>'详细信息','Back up now'=>'立即备份','Backups go to your own storage, not this server. <a href="%s">Connect your storage</a> first.'=>'备份会保存到您自己的存储空间，而不是此服务器。请先<a href="%s">连接您的存储空间</a>。','What to back up'=>'要备份的内容','Files and database'=>'文件和数据库','Database only'=>'仅数据库','Files only'=>'仅文件','Note (optional)'=>'备注（可选）','Each part is uploaded to your storage and removed from this server before the next one is made, so the backup never takes up room on your hosting.'=>'每个部分在生成下一个部分之前，都会上传到您的存储空间并从此服务器中删除，因此备份永远不会占用您主机的空间。','Your backups'=>'您的备份','Refresh'=>'刷新','Restore this backup'=>'恢复此备份','Passphrase'=>'密码短语','I understand this replaces this site’s files and database with the backup’s. Files that are not in the backup are kept.'=>'我了解这会将此站点的文件和数据库替换为备份中的文件和数据库。备份中不存在的文件将被保留。','Recent activity'=>'近期活动','Backup'=>'备份','Restore / import'=>'恢复 / 导入','Running'=>'正在运行','Your storage'=>'您的存储空间','No storage yet. Choose where your backups go below.'=>'尚无存储空间。请在下方选择备份的保存位置。','Ready'=>'就绪','Not connected'=>'未连接','Connect'=>'连接','Test'=>'测试','Edit'=>'编辑','Remove'=>'移除','Add storage'=>'添加存储','Backups go to one storage destination. To use a different one, edit or remove the one above.'=>'备份会发送到一个存储目的地。如需使用其他存储目的地，请编辑或移除上方的存储目的地。','Kind of storage'=>'存储类型','Name (for you)'=>'名称（仅您可见）','Provider'=>'提供商','Cloudflare account id'=>'Cloudflare 账户 ID','Endpoint address'=>'端点地址','Region'=>'区域','Bucket'=>'存储桶','Access key id'=>'访问密钥 ID','Secret access key'=>'秘密访问密钥','Leave empty to keep the saved key'=>'留空以保留已保存的密钥','For Cloudflare R2: in the Cloudflare dashboard open R2, create a bucket, then “Manage R2 API tokens” → create a token with Object Read & Write for that bucket, and copy the access key id and secret here.'=>'对于 Cloudflare R2：请在 Cloudflare 控制面板中打开 R2，创建一个存储桶，然后前往“Manage R2 API tokens”→ 为该存储桶创建一个具有 Object Read & Write 权限的令牌，并在此处复制访问密钥 ID（access key id）和机密密钥。','Dropbox app key'=>'Dropbox 应用密钥','Create an app at dropbox.com/developers/apps (Scoped access, App folder) with the files.content.read, files.content.write and files.metadata.read permissions, and copy its App key here. Save, then press Connect.'=>'在 dropbox.com/developers/apps (Scoped access, App folder) 创建一个具有 files.content.read、files.content.write 和 files.metadata.read 权限的应用程序，并将其 App key 复制到此处。保存，然后点击“连接”。','OAuth client id'=>'OAuth 客户端 ID','OAuth client secret'=>'OAuth 客户端密钥','Leave empty to keep the saved secret'=>'留空以保留已保存的密码','In Google Cloud Console, enable the Google Drive API, then create an OAuth client of type “Web application” with this address as an authorised redirect URI:'=>'在 Google Cloud Console 中，启用 Google Drive API，然后创建一个类型为“Web 应用程序”的 OAuth 客户端，并将此地址设置为已获授权的重定向 URI：','Save, then press Connect. The plugin only sees the files it creates.'=>'保存，然后点击连接。该插件只能看到其自身创建的文件。','Folder inside the storage (optional)'=>'存储中的文件夹（可选）','Save storage'=>'节省存储空间','Import a backup from another plugin or host'=>'从其他插件或主机导入备份','Bring a site in from a backup made by UpdraftPlus, All-in-One WP Migration (.wpress), Duplicator (zip), BackWPup, WPvivid, Jetpack VaultPress Backup, BlogVault, Zinn® Migrate, or any zip/tar archive of a WordPress site with its .sql dump. The content goes into wp-content and the database replaces this site’s; addresses are changed to this site’s automatically.'=>'从由 UpdraftPlus、All-in-One WP Migration (.wpress)、Duplicator (zip)、BackWPup、WPvivid、Jetpack VaultPress Backup、BlogVault、Zinn® Migrate 创建的备份，或包含其 .sql 转储的 WordPress 站点的任何 zip/tar 归档中导入站点。内容将进入 wp-content，数据库将替换此站点的数据库；地址会自动更改为此站点的地址。','Upload from your computer'=>'从您的计算机上传','Choose every file of the backup at once (UpdraftPlus makes several). Large files are sent in small pieces, so your host’s upload limit does not apply.'=>'请一次性选择备份的所有文件（UpdraftPlus 会生成多个文件）。大文件会分块发送，因此不受您主机的上传限制影响。','Or from links (Google Drive, Dropbox or any download address)'=>'或通过链接（Google Drive、Dropbox 或任何下载地址）','One link per line. For Google Drive and Dropbox, share the file with “anyone with the link” and paste that link; turn sharing off again afterwards.'=>'每行一个链接。对于 Google 云端硬盘和 Dropbox，请将文件共享给“任何拥有该链接的人”并粘贴该链接；之后请再次关闭共享。','Or a file already on this server'=>'或已在此服务器上的文件','Upload archives by FTP or your host’s file manager into %s and reload this page.'=>'请通过 FTP 或主机的文​​件管理器将归档上传到 %s，然后重新加载此页面。','Or a deploy code from another site'=>'或来自其他站点的部署代码','If another site gave you a Zinn® Backups deploy code, paste it here to copy that backup onto this site without sharing its storage keys. A code works for a few hours; treat it like a password.'=>'如果其他站点向您提供了 Zinn® Backups 部署代码，请将其粘贴在此处，以便将该备份复制到此站点，而无需共享其存储密钥。代码仅在数小时内有效；请像对待密码一样妥善保管。','Passphrase (only if that backup is encrypted)'=>'密码短语（仅在该备份已加密时）','Import'=>'导入','I understand the import replaces this site’s content and database. After it, sign in with an account from the imported site.'=>'我了解导入会替换此站点的內容和数据库。完成后，请使用导入站点中的账户登录。','Moving to Zinn® hosting?'=>'正在迁移到 Zinn® 主机？','Zinn Digital® can move your site for you from your old host. If your old host gives you no FTP, SSH or control-panel access, install Zinn® Migrate on the old site; it makes one archive you can import here or hand to Zinn®.'=>'Zinn Digital® 可以为您从旧主机迁移网站。如果您的旧主机不提供 FTP、SSH 或控制面板访问权限，请在旧网站上安装 Zinn® Migrate；它会生成一个归档文件，供您在此导入或提交给 Zinn®。','What goes into a backup'=>'备份中包含哪些内容','Include WordPress’s own files (wp-admin, wp-includes). Usually not needed: WordPress can always be reinstalled.'=>'包含 WordPress 自身的文件（wp-admin、wp-includes）。通常不需要：WordPress 始终可以重新安装。','Also leave out these folders or files (one per line, relative to the WordPress folder)'=>'同时排除这些文件夹或文件（每行一个，相对于 WordPress 文件夹）','Always left out: caches, update scratch space, and other backup plugins’ own archive folders:'=>'始终排除：缓存、更新暂存空间以及其他备份插件自身的归档文件夹：','Size of each part (MB)'=>'每个分卷的大小 (MB)','Save settings'=>'保存设置','A backup part could not be opened for writing. Check that wp-content has free space.'=>'无法打开备份分卷以进行写入。请检查 wp-content 是否有可用空间。','A backup part could not be written. Check that wp-content has free space.'=>'备份的一部分无法写入。请检查 wp-content 是否有可用空间。','Connect a storage destination on the Storage tab first: backups are kept in your own storage, not on this server.'=>'请先在 Storage 选项卡上连接存储目标位置：备份保存在您自己的存储空间中，而非此服务器上。','Multisite networks are not supported yet.'=>'尚不支持多站点网络。','This server’s PHP has no ZipArchive extension. Ask your host to enable it.'=>'此服务器的 PHP 没有 ZipArchive 扩展。请联系您的主机提供商以启用它。','Starting'=>'正在启动','Listing files'=>'正在列出文件','Backing up the database'=>'正在备份数据库','Packing files'=>'正在打包文件','Uploading to your storage'=>'正在上传至您的存储空间','Finishing'=>'正在完成','The backup reached an unknown stage.'=>'备份已达到未知阶段。','Backup %s started.'=>'%s 备份已开始。','Found %1$s files (%2$s).'=>'找到 %1$s 个文件 (%2$s)。','Database: %1$d tables, %2$s rows, %3$s compressed.'=>'数据库：%1$d 个表，%2$s 行，%3$s 已压缩。','Backup complete: %1$s stored in %2$d destination.'=>'备份完成：%1$s已存储在 %2$d 个目标位置。','Some parts already uploaded could not be removed from your storage; they are in an incomplete backup folder and are never offered for restore.'=>'部分已上传的内容无法从您的存储空间中移除；它们位于未完成的备份文件夹中，绝不会被提供用于恢复。','A storage destination was removed while the backup was running.'=>'备份正在运行时，某个存储目的地已被移除。','That is not a backup folder.'=>'那不是备份文件夹。','That storage destination is no longer saved on this site.'=>'该存储目标已不再保存在此站点上。','Later incremental backups are built on this one. Delete those first.'=>'后续的增量备份基于此备份构建。请先删除这些备份。','This file is not an encrypted Zinn® Backups file.'=>'此文件不是加密的 Zinn® Backups 文件。','The backup could not be decrypted: the passphrase is wrong or the file is damaged.'=>'备份无法解密：密码错误或文件已损坏。','The encrypted backup file is incomplete.'=>'加密的备份文件不完整。','The database file could not be written. Check that wp-content has free space.'=>'无法写入数据库文件。请检查 wp-content 是否有可用空间。','That is not a deploy code. A deploy code starts with zbdeploy1.'=>'那不是部署代码。部署代码以 zbdeploy1 开头。','That deploy code is damaged. Copy it again from the other site.'=>'该部署代码已损坏。请从另一个站点重新复制它。','The deploy code has expired or its backup was deleted. Make a new code on the other site.'=>'部署代码已过期或其备份已被删除。请在另一个站点上生成新代码。','That deploy code does not point at a Zinn® Backups backup.'=>'该部署代码未指向 Zinn® Backups 备份。','The deploy code has expired. Make a new code on the other site.'=>'部署代码已过期。请在另一个站点上生成新代码。','The server stopped honouring partial downloads. Start the import again.'=>'服务器已停止支持断点续传。请重新开始导入。','The link opened a web page instead of a file. For Google Drive and Dropbox, share the file with “anyone with the link” and paste that link.'=>'该链接打开了网页而非文件。对于 Google Drive 和 Dropbox，请将文件共享为“知道链接的任何人”，并粘贴该链接。','The link answered with HTTP %d.'=>'链接返回了 HTTP %d。','The file list could not be written.'=>'无法写入文件列表。','The storage service could not be reached: %s'=>'无法访问存储服务：%s','%1$s answered with HTTP %2$d: %3$s'=>'%1$s 返回了 HTTP %2$d：%3$s','no details given'=>'未提供详细信息','You are not allowed to manage backups.'=>'您无权管理备份。','Tick the box to confirm that the restore replaces this site’s files and database.'=>'勾选该复选框以确认恢复操作将替换此站点的文件和数据库。','Save the destination first.'=>'请先保存目标地址。','Connected: a test file was written and removed.'=>'已连接：测试文件已写入并删除。','Enter the app key of your Dropbox app first (see the steps beside the form).'=>'请先输入您的 Dropbox 应用的应用密钥（请参阅表单旁边的步骤）。','This kind of storage does not sign in.'=>'此类存储不进行登录。','The sign-in expired. Press Connect again.'=>'登录已过期。请再次点击连接。','Dropbox is connected.'=>'Dropbox 已连接。','Settings saved.'=>'设置已保存。','Another backup, restore or import is running. Wait for it to finish, or cancel it.'=>'另一个备份、恢复或导入正在运行。请等待其完成，或将其取消。','The upload was not started properly. Start again.'=>'上传未正常开始。请重新开始。','The chunk did not arrive. Your server may limit upload sizes; try again.'=>'分块未送达。您的服务器可能会限制上传大小；请重试。','Tick the box to confirm that the import replaces this site’s content and database.'=>'勾选该框以确认导入将替换本站点的所有内容和数据库。','Choose an archive to import: upload it, paste a link, or pick one from the import folder.'=>'选择要导入的归档：上传它、粘贴链接或从导入文件夹中选取。','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'托管客户？获取 %2$s 的 %1$d%% 折扣','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'作为 Zinn Digital® 托管客户，您可获得用于首次付款享受 %d%% 折扣的专属代码。续费按正常价格收取。','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'获取我的 %d%% 折扣码并前往结账','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'抱歉，您没有权限执行此操作。','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'此折扣适用于拥有状态良好之付费托管方案的客户。免费试用不符合资格。','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'您已为该插件使用过您的托管客户折扣。','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'我们刚才无法获取您的验证码。请在几分钟后重试。','Reading the backup'=>'正在读取备份','Downloading the archive'=>'正在下载归档','Recognising the archive'=>'正在识别归档','Restoring files'=>'正在恢复文件','Downloading the database'=>'正在下载数据库','Restoring the database'=>'正在恢复数据库','Updating the site address'=>'正在更新站点地址','Switching to the restored database'=>'正在切换到已恢复的数据库','The restore reached an unknown stage.'=>'恢复过程进入了未知阶段。','This folder has no complete Zinn® Backups backup in it (the manifest is missing).'=>'此文件夹中没有完整的 Zinn® Backups 备份（缺少清单）。','This backup is encrypted. Enter its passphrase to restore it.'=>'此備份已加密。請輸入密碼短語以還原。','This incremental backup needs backup %s, which is no longer in the storage.'=>'此增量备份需要备份 %s，但该备份已不在存储中。','Restoring the backup of %1$s (%2$d file parts).'=>'正在恢复 %1$s 的备份（%2$d 个文件分卷）。','%1$s file could not be overwritten because this site is not allowed to change it, and was left as it is: %2$s'=>'无法覆盖文件 %1$s，因为此站点无权修改该文件，已保留原样：%2$s','Restored %s files.'=>'已恢复 %s 个文件。','%s did not match its checksum after downloading. The copy in storage may be damaged.'=>'%s 下载后与校验和不匹配。存储中的副本可能已损坏。','%s did not arrive. Upload it again.'=>'%s未送达。请重新上传。','Recognised: %s.'=>'已识别：%s。','Imported %1$s files into wp-content (%2$s left out: caches, drop-ins and other backup plugins’ folders).'=>'已将 %1$s 个文件导入至 wp-content（已忽略 %2$s 个：缓存、drop-in 和其他备份插件的文件夹）。','The archive has no database dump, so only files were imported.'=>'存档中没有数据库转储，因此仅导入了文件。','Database restored into %d temporary tables.'=>'数据库已恢复至 %d 个临时表中。','%s has no WordPress tables in it and was skipped.'=>'%s 中没有 WordPress 数据表，已跳过。','The backup’s database has no WordPress tables, so nothing was replaced.'=>'备份的数据库中没有 WordPress 数据表，因此未替换任何内容。','This backup is of a multisite network. Restoring a network into a single site is not supported.'=>'此备份属于多站点网络。不支持将网络恢复至单个站点。','Moving the content from %1$s to %2$s.'=>'正在将内容从 %1$s 移动到 %2$s。','Restore complete. If you are signed out, sign in with an account from the restored site.'=>'恢复完成。如果您已退出登录，请使用已恢复网站的帐户登录。','Restore complete.'=>'恢复完成。','%1$s — trying again in %2$d seconds.'=>'%1$s — 将在 %2$d 秒后重试。','Cancelled.'=>'已取消。','Backups go to one storage destination. Edit or remove the one you have to use a different one.'=>'备份会发送到一个存储目的地。请编辑或移除您现有的目的地以使用其他目的地。','The database file could not be opened.'=>'无法打开数据库文件。','The database refused a statement from the backup: %1$s (%2$s…)'=>'数据库拒绝了来自备份的语句：%1$s（%2$s…）','The restored tables could not be swapped in: %s. Your site is unchanged.'=>'无法调换已恢复的表：%s。您的站点未发生更改。','There is no writable folder for temporary backup files. Make wp-content writable and try again.'=>'没有可用于临时备份文件的可写文件夹。请将 wp-content 设为可写，然后重试。','Could not create a folder for this job.'=>'无法为此任务创建文件夹。','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — 指南与服务','User guides'=>'用户指南','Read the %s user guide'=>'阅读 %s 用户指南','Hide this'=>'隐藏此项','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'适用于 WordPress 的 Zinn® 托管','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed、每日备份、免费迁移以及专为管理多个网站的用户打造的控制面板。','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® 市场','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'买卖成熟网站、域名和外链位置，资金安全托管，直至买卖双方均满意为止。','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — 聘请以此为生的专业人员','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'我们的全球自由职业市场：浏览由作者、设计师、开发者和 SEO 专家提供的超过 10,000 种现成服务，或者发布项目让他们竞标。','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'查看 Zinn Digital® 发行说明。','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Zinn® 更新服务未提供此更新的下载链接。请检查此站点是否可以访问 Zinn® 平台，然后重试。','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'无法从 Zinn® 更新服务（%s）下载更新。请在几分钟后重试。','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'下载的更新未通过完整性检查，未予安装。','The zip archive could not be opened. It may be damaged or incomplete.'=>'无法打开 zip 压缩文件。它可能已损坏或不完整。','This .wpress file uses a format we cannot read (it may be compressed or encrypted by All-in-One WP Migration). Export it again without encryption.'=>'此 .wpress 文件使用了我们无法读取的格式（可能已被 All-in-One WP Migration 压缩或加密）。请在不加密的情况下重新导出。','This is a Duplicator “DupArchive” (.daf) file. In Duplicator, build the package again with the archive format set to ZIP, then import that.'=>'这是一个 Duplicator “DupArchive” (.daf) 文件。在 Duplicator 中，将归档格式设置为 ZIP 重新构建该安装包，然后将其导入。','This UpdraftPlus database backup is encrypted. Decrypt it in UpdraftPlus (or turn off database encryption and back up again), then import it.'=>'此 UpdraftPlus 数据库备份已加密。请在 UpdraftPlus 中将其解密（或关闭数据库加密并重新备份），然后再进行导入。','Database dump'=>'数据库转储','%s is not a backup archive we can read (zip, tar, tar.gz, .wpress, .sql or .sql.gz).'=>'%s 不是我们可读取的备份存档（zip、tar、tar.gz、.wpress、.sql 或 .sql.gz）。','Website archive'=>'网站归档','%s has no WordPress content (no wp-content folder and no database dump) in it.'=>'%s 中没有 WordPress 内容（没有 wp-content 文件夹，也没有数据库转储）。','This .wpress file is encrypted or compressed by All-in-One WP Migration. Export it again with encryption and compression switched off, then import that.'=>'此 .wpress 文件已被 All-in-One WP Migration 加密或压缩。请在关闭加密和压缩功能后重新导出，然后再导入该文件。','Other S3-compatible storage'=>'其他兼容 S3 的存储','Cloudflare R2, Amazon S3 or S3-compatible'=>'Cloudflare R2、Amazon S3 或兼容 S3','The storage keys could not be read on this site. Enter the secret key again on the Storage tab.'=>'无法在此站点上读取存储密钥。请在“存储”选项卡上重新输入密钥。','This kind of storage is not known.'=>'这种存储类型是未知的。','Choose a kind of storage.'=>'请选择一种存储类型。','Enter the bucket name and the access key.'=>'请输入存储桶名称和访问密钥。','Enter your Cloudflare account id (or the full R2 endpoint).'=>'输入您的 Cloudflare 账户 ID（或完整的 R2 终端节点）。','Enter the endpoint address of your storage.'=>'请输入您的存储终端节点地址。','Enter the OAuth client id from your Google Cloud project.'=>'请输入您的 Google Cloud 项目中的 OAuth client id。','Dropbox did not return a refresh token. Start the connection again.'=>'Dropbox 未返回刷新令牌。请重新发起连接。','Dropbox is not connected. Connect it again on the Storage tab.'=>'Dropbox 未连接。请在“存储”选项卡上重新连接。','Google did not return a refresh token. Remove this site from your Google account’s third-party access and connect again.'=>'Google 未返回刷新令牌。请从您的 Google 帐号的第三方访问权限中移除此网站，然后重新连接。','That file is not in Google Drive any more.'=>'该文件已不在 Google Drive 中。','Google Drive is not connected. Connect it again on the Storage tab.'=>'Google Drive 未连接。请在“存储”选项卡中重新连接。','The storage service did not start the upload.'=>'存储服务未开始上传。','The storage service sent a reply that could not be read.'=>'存储服务发送了无法读取的回复。','A temporary backup file could not be read.'=>'无法读取临时备份文件。','A deploy link is read-only.'=>'部署链接是只读的。','The deploy code has no link for a file this backup needs.'=>'部署代码中没有此备份所需文件的链接。','The deploy link'=>'部署链接']];